sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor I as Investor
    participant W as Web app
    participant P as PaymentsController
    participant SV as PaymentService
    participant PR as IPaymentProvider
    participant DB as SQL Server
    participant FM as FundingMath

    I->>W: open checkout on an approved commitment
    W->>P: POST /api/payments/checkout
    P->>SV: OpenCheckoutAsync
    SV->>DB: assert approved, unexpired, unsettled
    SV->>DB: create FundingRequest (with expiry)
    SV->>PR: CreateCheckoutAsync
    PR-->>SV: session id + url
    SV->>DB: create PaymentTransaction (Pending, Provider stamped)
    SV-->>P: checkout url
    P-->>W: 200
    I->>PR: complete payment on the provider surface
    Note over I,PR: no card data touches the platform

    PR->>P: POST /api/payments/webhook/stripe
    P->>P: verify signature over the raw body (constant time)
    alt signature invalid
        P-->>PR: 400 - rejected and logged, no state change
    else valid
        P->>DB: insert PaymentEvent (ProviderEventId unique)
        alt duplicate event
            P-->>PR: 200 - already handled, stop
        else new
            P->>SV: ApplyProviderEventAsync
            SV->>DB: PaymentTransaction to Settled
            P-->>PR: 200
        end
    end
    W->>FM: read venture funding
    FM->>DB: SUM over Settled transactions only
    FM-->>W: raised amount (derived, never stored)
